id: _agent_shared
name: Agent library
version: 1.0.0
description: 'The Agent generator''s runtime: its session (session, run on a document, a chat or the harness''s
  own terminal), every harness adapter under harnesses/ with its pipeline, the ACP client, the MCP bridge
  that serves the workspace, handler and web tools to a harness, model and Git account reading, command
  approval, and the test_generator tool. It imports _env_shared, so a cell that names it under shared:
  names _env_shared too. Import it as _agent_shared.'
